@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1

### 目錄（版本下拉選單）
GET {{api}}/catalog?market=TW

### 版本規格：1 = 後輪驅動、2 = Long Range、3 = Performance
GET {{api}}/trims/3

### 參數化模型資源
GET {{api}}/assets/1

### 部位與建議配件
GET {{api}}/parts

### 建立配置清單
# @name create
POST {{api}}/builds
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "我的 Model Y", "trimId": 1, "paintColorId": 1 }

###
@buildId = {{create.response.body.$.id}}

### 新增配件
# @name acc
POST {{api}}/builds/{{buildId}}/accessories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partCode": "front-bumper",
  "name": "全車犀牛皮 PPF",
  "assetId": 1,
  "priceTwd": 68000,
  "position": { "p": [2.46, 0.48, 0.3], "n": [1, 0, 0] }
}

### 修改狀態
PATCH {{api}}/builds/{{buildId}}/accessories/{{acc.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "purchased" }

### 切換版本
PATCH {{api}}/builds/{{buildId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trimId": 3 }

### 取得配置清單
GET {{api}}/builds/{{buildId}}

### 健康檢查
GET http://localhost:5080/health
